\section{System Modeling}
The system to be modeled -illustrated in Fig. \ref{fig:sytem}- can be described as a cantilever beam with a magnet attached at one end with mass $m$, and an electromagnet positioned nearby above, capable of attracting or repelling the magnet when a voltage $V(t)$ is applied to its terminals, and a sensor used to measure the distance $y(t)$ between the magnet and the electromagnet with an offset $y_0$.

