\caption{Forest plot showing OR and 95\% CI for predictors of emotion recognition accuracy. The dashed vertical line indicates no effect (OR = 1). Statistically significant predictors are clearly indicated. \textit{Reference levels:} Avatar = Amelia, Condition = visual-only, Emotion = intended.}
\label{fig:forest_em}
