\paragraph{Bounding the size of $\vd(\oq,\os)$, i.e., $|\oq|$.} We now prove $|\oq|\leq C'n/k$. To this end, we compare it against a $(5k,5c_0k)$-shallow cutting $(Q^*,S^*)$ of size at most $c_0'n/(5k)$ for some constant $c_0'$, whose existence is guaranteed by Corollary~\ref{coro:shallowexist20}. 

We set constant $B\geq 15c_0$. We first claim that $\vd(\iq,\is)$ covers $\vd(Q^*,S^*)$. Indeed, 
