consider a cell $\Delta\in \vd(Q^*,S^*)$. 
By Observation~\ref{obser:cellconlist}, $\Delta$ intersects at most $15c_0k$ arcs of $\Gamma$. Hence, $\Delta\subseteq L_{\leq 15c_0k}(\Gamma)$.  As $\vd(\iq,\is)$ covers $L_{\leq Bk}(\calA)$ and $B\geq 15c_0$, $\Delta\subseteq\vd(\iq,\is)$. Hence, $\vd(\iq,\is)$ covers $\vd(Q^*,S^*)$. 

