We render $(Q^*,S^*)$ comparable to $(\oq,\os)$ by performing three modification steps: (1) Add some points to $Q^*$; (2) modify $S^*$; (3) remove some points of $Q^*$. Note that these modification steps are not part of the algorithm but for this proof only. 
