possibly empty sequence of \emph{Independent Keywords} %or triples 
(IK), followed by
a possibly empty sequence of \emph{Statically Dependent} keywords (SDK), followed by
a possibly empty sequence of \emph{Annotation Dependent} keywords (ADK).
