Specifically, the two keywords in \key{SDK}, {\qaddProps} and {\qits},
depend on the syntactic content of three keywords in
\key{IK} ($\qprops$, $\qpattProps$, $\qprefIts$),
and the two keywords in \key{ADK} depend on the annotations returned by the keywords in \key{SDK}
and in  \key{IK}.
