at least one structural keyword; this constraint is called ``well-formedness''
in \cite{DBLP:conf/www/PezoaRSUV16,DBLP:conf/pods/BourhisRSV17}, 
``guarded recursion'' in \cite{DBLP:journals/pvldb/AttoucheBCGSS22}, and ``no infinite recursive nesting'' in the
specifications (\cite{specs2020}, Section 9.4.1). Guarded recursion can be defined as follows.
