Since $breadth(L(s, G))\le 2k$, $\rho(G)\le \rho_s(G)\le breadth(L(s, G))+1$, $length(L(s, G))\le 2\cdot breadth(L(s, G))$, and $\Delta(G)\le \Delta_s(G)\le length(L(s, G))+1$, we have  $\rho(G)\le 2k+1=2\cdot\dsp(G)+1$ and  $\Delta(G)\le 4\cdot\dsp(G)+1$. Applying Lemma   \ref{lm:layer-length} and taking into account $breadth(L(s, G))\le 2k$, we conclude also $\adc(G)\le 4k=4\cdot\dsp(G)$ (but this bound is not better than the bound established in Lemma  \ref{lem:adc-dsp-upperb}, when $\dsp(G)>0$).    % $\adc(G)\le 2\cdot \dsp(G)+2$.

