For relations between $\pat(G)$, $\pcc(G)$ and $\dsp(G)$, $\dpr(G)$, $\Delta(G)$,  %Combining Theorem  \ref{th:adc-pl} and Theorem  \ref{th:pat-pl}, 
we get the following. 

\begin{corollary}  \label{cor:ineq-pl-pat-dsp}  
For every graph $G$, % that is not a path itself,   
 $$\dsp(G)\le \dpr(G)\le \pat(G)\le  \pcc(G)\le   6\cdot \dsp(G)\le  6\cdot \dpr(G),$$  
