    \item Loss difference-based client selection directly influences the accuracy by approximately 5\%, regardless of the chosen head pruning strategy, as shown in the comparison between two consecutive rows.
    \item Client selection does not impact the convergence rate independently, as indicated by the consistent number of rounds required to reach 70\% accuracy in both B1 (5 rounds) and B2 (17 rounds).
