    \item Importance score based head pruning strategy alone enhances convergence rate (17 rounds in B2 to 9 rounds in ours) and improves accuracy by $>$1\% compared to random pruning (B2).
    \item Combining head importance-based pruning with loss-based client selection yields higher accuracy and convergence rate compared to FedAvg with random pruning (B2) and achieves similar accuracy to FedAvg without pruning (B1).
